{"version":1,"content":"<p>以量產車型為基礎的各類賽車運動，既講求輕量化，亦愈來愈講求所用物料的可持續性。</p><p>當中便嚴格要求賽車的改裝外觀件，必須使用可持續的天然纖維複合物料。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;而最近在複合材料領擁有專業技術的日產（Nissan）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T11:23:57.695686+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T11:00:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T11:17:14.022541+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T11:17:14.022541+00:00","content_hash":"a3f406b27962d0d66fd34752fdc7360aee213e5c97e70ae16b08bc6658b4d975","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}